# ── Desktop app (desktop/) ────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# This used to be a bare `desktop/`, which ignored the whole client while 40 of
# its files were already tracked — so every NEW desktop file was left out of
# every commit silently (found 2026-09-23: the plan-ladder, usage-limit and
# settings work shipped on web but never reached a commit on desktop).
# Ignore build output and local secrets only; the source is product code.
desktop/app/node_modules/
desktop/app/out/
desktop/app/dist/
desktop/app/release/
desktop/app/.eslintcache
desktop/app/.env*.local
desktop/sidecar/build/
desktop/sidecar/dist/
desktop/sidecar/__pycache__/
desktop/_removed/

# Load-test fixtures that are GENERATED, not authored: the realistic clip is
# ~530 MB and the runner's Dockerfile encodes both of them at build time
# (loadtest/runner/Dockerfile). Only the small 8-second one is committed.
loadtest/fixtures/clip_long.mp4
loadtest/fixtures/proxy_long.mp4
